00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:52.460
I've talked a lot over the years about food in prison

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.260
I hate to even call it food, to tell you the truth

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:56.660
It was slop

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.060
On my very first full day in prison, it was a Friday

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:03.860
One of the Italians with whom I became very friendly, Pete Calabrese

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:08.460
Mentioned offhandedly that it's Friday, that means it's fish day

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:11.460
And I responded by saying, oh great, I love fish

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.260
And he said, oh, don't eat this fish

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.060
We call it sewer trout and it's not fit for human consumption

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:21.060
Well, he and I walked down to the chow hall together

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:24.260
And what I saw was something that I'll never forget

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:29.260
The guys in the chow line were slopping the slop onto your tray

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:34.660
But behind them were boxes, boxes of fish

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:38.060
And on the side of these boxes, every one of them

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:42.460
It was clearly marked Alaskan cod, product of China

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:46.460
Feed use only, not for human consumption

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.060
And that's what they were putting on our plates

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:51.860
I looked at Pete, he said, I told ya

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:55.660
And so I never, ever, ever ate the fish

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:59.860
I've also talked about another incident that happened about halfway through my sentence

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:03.660
Where every Wednesday night was so-called taco night

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:06.660
And excuse the filthy thing I'm gonna say

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:09.060
I once threw away the entire taco

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.460
And the warden saw me throw the whole thing away

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:15.260
And he said, in the old days you could get written up for that

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:19.660
And I responded, I've eaten ass that tasted better than this taco

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:22.060
What do you do if you can't eat the food?

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.660
If you won't eat the food?

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.260
If you shouldn't eat the food?

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.260
If the food is gonna make you sick?

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.860
I'm John Kiriakou

