Yes, I wanted to ask you about that

00:10:15.860 --> 00:10:16.860
Yes

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.860
So I had a good hookup right there

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.860
Especially when I got with the, can we say names on here?

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:24.860
Sure, why not?

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:26.860
We'll believe you later if we have to

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.860
When I got with Nicky Carrazzo

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:29.860
Yes

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:31.860
I had to learn to hold nine yards

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:36.860
Yeah, because Nicky was a very, very important person

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:40.860
In a certain Italian-American subculture

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:41.860
Yeah

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:43.860
And very important person

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:47.860
And as his status demanded

00:10:47.860 --> 00:10:49.860
He got the best of everything

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:50.860
Including the best food

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:55.860
Our friend Mark Lanzalotti, who was an absolutely brilliant cook

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:57.860
I once told him, he fed me

00:10:57.860 --> 00:11:00.860
It was on my birthday, it was my 50th birthday

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:02.860
He had a big bash for me

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:03.860
I remember

00:11:03.860 --> 00:11:04.860
Remember that?

00:11:04.860 --> 00:11:05.860
I told my wife that night

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.860
It was the first time I had smiled in nine months

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:08.860
Yeah

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:11.860
